  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 606.03 Attendance. Commission members shall attend each regular and special meeting of the commission or shall contact commission staff at least 24 hours prior to a meeting the member will be unable to attend.\n\nSource. #9553, eff 9-25-09, EXPIRED: 9-25-17\n\nNew. #12938, eff 12-9-19",
